(memory "diagnostics/failures" :on (asks "a call failed and the agent must fix the name, the arguments or a keyword from what the failure said"))
- Unknown name: gives nearest existing name and signature. Call it. Do not list
  server tools to find a name failure already gave.
- Wrong argument count or shape: gives signature and argument count. Fix call
  from that line, do not guess again.
- Keyword argument not taken: gives nearest valid one, or whole list when none
  close, plus signature. Use name given, do not reread docs.

Suggestion is nearest match, not promise. Wrong name? (doc) and tool list still
there.
